  "abstract": "Same ramp-initialized Fourier LN baseline, but with Adam lr=9e-4 (vs 1e-3) to test stability; includes residual copy, clip=1.0, MAE+curvature (\u03bb=1e-4). Exports gamma/frequency stats on complete().",
